```Title: PowerShell Executing Payload Stored in the Registry (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1027.011 | Severity: high | Sigma id: d30d59a9-7d38-4bca-a3e7-5701d5d75161```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Management scripts that keep encoded configuration in the registry```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity high.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
(Image IN ("*\\powershell.exe", "*\\pwsh.exe") CommandLine IN ("*Get-ItemProperty*", "*gp *") CommandLine IN ("*HKCU:*", "*HKLM:*", "*Registry::*") CommandLine IN ("*FromBase64String*", "*IEX*", "*Invoke-Expression*"))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
